  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "RendererBehaviour is the core rendering engine implementation, inheriting from EntityBehaviour and implementing IRendererBehaviour. It manages the entire WebGL rendering pipeline, handling state setup (culling, depth, blending), shader management, and executing draw calls for meshes. It provides specialized methods for rendering primitives like points and lines, and supports complex state serialization/deserialization for scene persistence. It heavily interacts with WebGL context and CanvasViewport for rendering operations."
  },
